DESCRIPTION:Come to Green Library to check out a book display in honor of 
 the American Library Association's Banned Books Week. From "All Quiet on t
 he Western Front" to "The Color Purple\," and "Das Kapital" to "Maus\," al
 l of these titles have been banned or challenged at some point. The displa
 y will run from October 2-16\, and all featured books are available to che
 ck out with a library card.\n\nAges: All ages\nLast synced: 2026-10-09 11:
 40 PDT
